 "text": "9/29/26, 9:47 AM\nReuse of Rate and Interface for Other Customer Groups\n\n1. You can copy a time-of-use interface (Create from Template) and change the consumption periods.\n\n2.|In the rate facts, allocate the new interface to a different fact group (for example, Residential Customers South).\n\n3. For the operands, enter the same result parameters as operand values.\n\nSimulation of Time-of-Use Billing for Interval Meters\n\nUse\n\nThe time-of-use interface provides you with a simulation mode that you can use to simulate billing for interval meters in SAP EDM.\nThe following forms of simulation are supported:\n\nSimulation on the Basis of Master Data\n\ne Budget billing simulation (for example during move-in, except in the express transaction Change Budget Billing Amount\nEA61EX)\n\ne Unbilled revenue reporting (mass billing of simulation indexes)\n\ne Billing simulation without a billable billing order\n\nYou can execute the simulation as an individual or mass activity.\n\ni Note\nNote that unbilled revenue reporting is significantly more runtime-intensive than billing conventional discrete interval meters.\n\nPrerequisites\n\nYou have activated the business function Utilities, Advanced Metering Infrastructure 3 (ISU AMI_ 3) and also made the following\n\nsettings:\n\nActivity                                                                   Path:\n\nDefine Consumption Pattern                                           SAP Implementation Guide >\u00bb SAP Utilities \u00bb Contract Billing > Billing\nMaster Data \u00bb AMI: Time-of-Use Interface \u00bb Define Consumption Pattern\n\nChange Consumption Pattern to Synthetic Profile               SAP Easy Access \u00bb SAP menu > Utilities Industry > Billing * Master Data\n\nAssignment                                                             AMI: Time-Of-Use Interface \u00bb Change Consumption Pattern to Profile\nAssignment\n\nEdit Time-of-Use Interface                                               SAP Implementation Guide \u00bb* SAP Utilities \u00bb Contract Billing > Billing\n\nMaster Data \u00bb AMI: Time-of-Use Interface \u00bb Edit Time-of-Use Interface\n\nor\n\nSAP Easy Access SAP menu \u00bb Utilities Industry Billing Master Data\nAMI: Time-Of-Use Interface \u00bb Edit Time-Of-Use Interface\n",
